      "problem": "Students with food allergies or dietary restrictions find it challenging to quickly identify safe food options in bustling dining halls.",
      "solution": "These kiosks offer an accessible and updated source of allergen data, empowering students to make informed and safe food choices with confidence."
    },
    {
      "title": "Student-Curated 'Best Value' Meal Recommendations",
