      "solution": "These sessions provide direct access to professional guidance, helping students make informed dietary choices that support their health and academic performance."
    },
    {
      "title": "Weekly 'Dining Hall Feature' Previews",
      "description": "A weekly email or app notification highlighting special menus, visiting chefs, or unique food offerings at different dining locations.",
      "problem": "Students may miss out on exciting or limited-time food experiences available across campus dining.",
      "solution": "This keeps students informed about culinary highlights, encouraging them to explore different dining halls and try new dishes."
    },
    {
      "title": "Emergency Meal Voucher System",
      "description": "A discreet system allowing students facing immediate financial hardship or unexpected meal plan issues to receive a temporary meal voucher.",
      "problem": "Unforeseen circumstances can leave students without funds for immediate food needs.",
      "solution": "This provides a critical safety net, ensuring no student goes hungry due to temporary financial or logistical challenges."
    },
    {
      "title": "Campus 'Ghost Kitchen' Spotlight",
