      "solution": "This initiative makes food more affordable for students while significantly cutting down on food waste and recovering some costs."
    },
    {
      "title": "Campus 'Food Pantry' Stock Update Alerts",
      "description": "A notification system that alerts students when the campus food pantry has received new donations or specific high-demand items.",
