      "solution": "This ensures students in need are promptly informed about available food, maximizing their access to essential resources."
    },
    {
      "title": "Shared Kitchen Access Schedule App",
      "description": "An app to view and book time slots for shared kitchen facilities in residence halls or other campus buildings.",
      "problem": "Students living in dorms without full kitchens often struggle to coordinate access to limited communal cooking spaces.",
      "solution": "This app simplifies booking and scheduling, ensuring fair access and efficient use of shared kitchen resources for all residents."
    },
    {
      "title": "International Cuisine Tasting Events",
      "description": "Regularly scheduled events featuring diverse international dishes prepared by campus dining or guest chefs.",
      "problem": "Students may have limited exposure to a wide variety of global cuisines during their first year.",
      "solution": "These events provide an enjoyable and educational opportunity for students to explore different food cultures and expand their culinary horizons."
    },
    {
      "title": "Hydration Station Locator Map",
      "description": "An interactive map highlighting the locations of all water bottle filling stations and drinking fountains across campus.",
      "problem": "Students may have difficulty locating accessible water sources, especially when on the go.",
      "solution": "This map ensures students can easily find stations to refill their water bottles, promoting hydration and reducing the need for single-use plastic bottles."
    },
    {
      "title": "Meal Plan 'Flexibility' Consultation Service",
      "description": "On-demand appointments with meal plan advisors to discuss and adjust meal plan selections based on changing student needs.",
      "problem": "Initial meal plan choices might not always align with a student's actual consumption patterns throughout the semester.",
      "solution": "This service offers personalized support, allowing students to make informed adjustments to their meal plans for better value and satisfaction."
    },
    {
      "title": "Campus 'Farm-to-Table' Dining Highlights",
      "description": "A dedicated section in dining hall menus or a separate newsletter showcasing meals made with locally sourced ingredients from university farms or regional partners.",
      "problem": "Students may be unaware of or unable to easily identify campus dining's commitment to fresh, local produce.",
      "solution": "This promotes awareness of sustainable food practices and highlights the availability of fresh, healthy, locally sourced meal options."
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Discount Partnerships with Local Restaurants",
      "description": "A curated list and promotional system for discounts offered by off-campus restaurants specifically for NC State students.",
      "problem": "Students often seek affordable dining options outside of the campus meal plan but may not know where to find deals.",
      "solution": "This program connects students with local eateries offering savings, expanding their dining choices and budget-friendliness."
    },
    {
      "title": "Nutritional Information Comparison Tool",
      "description": "An online tool allowing students to compare the nutritional content of different meal options available across campus dining.",
      "problem": "Making healthy choices can be difficult without an easy way to compare the nutritional value of various meals.",
      "solution": "This tool empowers students to make informed decisions about their nutrition by providing clear, comparative data on campus food offerings."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "ideas": [
    {
      "title": "Pre-Semester Course Syllabus Breakdown Workshops",
      "description": "Host optional workshops before the semester begins where faculty or senior TAs walk through common syllabus structures and expectations for challenging courses. Many freshmen feel overwhelmed by the initial volume of information and potential academic rigor presented in their first syllabi. These sessions would demystify academic requirements and set a clearer foundation for success.",
      "category": "academic life"
    },
    {
      "title": "Academic 'Office Hours' Sign-up System",
      "description": "Implement a centralized online system for students to view professor and TA office hours and sign up for specific time slots, especially for popular courses. Students often struggle to find availability or understand how to best utilize office hours, leading to missed opportunities for academic support. This system would streamline the process and encourage more proactive engagement with instructors.",
      "category": "studying"
    },
    {
      "title": "Digital 'Study Group Finder' Platform",
      "description": "Create a university-sanctioned platform where students can post requests or join existing study groups based on course, major, or specific topics. Difficulty finding compatible peers for collaborative study is a common hurdle for freshmen adjusting to university-level coursework. This tool would facilitate peer-to-peer learning and reduce feelings of academic isolation.",
      "category": "studying"
    },
    {
      "title": "Campus-Wide 'Quiet Study Space' Availability Tracker",
      "description": "Develop a real-time tracker showing the occupancy levels of various quiet study areas across campus, such as libraries and designated quiet zones in academic buildings. Finding a suitable, quiet environment for focused study can be challenging due to unpredictable availability. This would help students efficiently locate productive study spaces without wasted time searching.",
      "category": "studying"
    },
